Package: com.samcejko.spot6
Name: Spot6
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Unofficial Spotify client for iOS 6 (universal), in English and Czech: Home, search, your library and playlists, albums, artists, podcasts, synced lyrics, queue, shuffle and repeat, song radio, gapless playback in up to 320 kbit/s, the lock screen controls. Log in from the Spotify app on your phone. Needs Spotify Premium.
Maintainer: samcejko
Author: samcejko
Section: Multimedia
Depends: firmware (>= 6.0)
